      "statusChangeID": "67a3b0e08bcfbfc4e73f3256",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "The message you are seeing is not preventing any downloads. It simply indicates that _after you publish_ your world, you would need to add that domain on the website so it works in public instances. Build & Test instances behave like a private instance, in that no special blocking occurs.\n\nThis means your issue lies somewhere else, though unfortunately from the information provided I can not tell you where that is. I will close this issue unless you can provide a reproducable example of a bug unrelated to the logged message. We may consider rewording that message in the future to avoid confusion.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
